# makepkg refuses to source a PKGBUILD containing CRLF, and GitHub's Windows
# runners check out with core.autocrlf=true by default, so a repository that is
# pure LF in git still lands as CRLF there. Pin the line endings on checkout so
# the working tree is usable wherever it is cloned.
#
#   ==> ERROR: PKGBUILD contains CRLF characters and cannot be sourced.
#
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pkg.tar.zst binary
